{"id":"cdba3b9b4f1070bc","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-setlike-class.md","title":"ZFC Setlike Class","display":"df-zfc-setlike-class — ZFC Setlike Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-setlike-class","aliases":["58-df-zfc-setlike-class"],"display":"df-zfc-setlike-class — ZFC Setlike Class","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-setlike-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-setlike-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-setlike-class — ZFC Setlike Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"58-df-class\">58-df-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> (definable-class parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{IsSet}_S\\)</span> (represented-by-a-set class predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"58-df-class\">58-df-class</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SetlikeClass}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SetlikeClass}_S\\)</span> (unary class predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}setlike\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{SetlikeClass}_S(C) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{IsSet}_S(C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}setlike\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{SetlikeClass}_S(C) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{IsSet}_S(C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A definable class is setlike exactly when its extension is represented by a set.</li>\n<li>Requiring only <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\cap x\">\\(C\\cap x\\)</span> to be a set for every set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> would be degenerate here: every definable class has that property by Separation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-class","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-class","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsSet}_S$ (represented-by-a-set class predicate, see [[58-df-class]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SetlikeClass}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}setlike\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{SetlikeClass}_S(C) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{IsSet}_S(C)","display":true},{"tex":"C\\cap x","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false}],"bytes":859,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3469","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-setlike-class.md|58-df-zfc-setlike-class]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","ca2a9c9166fa8cce"]}